OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran researches war graves to
OL,4,Atell town's stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army veteran who has researched
OL,7,Fevery war grave in his local cemetery
OL,8,Fis urging people to remember those
OL,9,Fbehind the names this Remembrance Day.
OL,11,FPaul Bushnell, 66, has spent the last
OL,12,Ftwo years studying all 134 of the plots
OL,13,Fin Pontefract cemetery, West Yorkshire.
OL,15,FHe has even helped families discover
OL,16,Frelatives buried there they never knew
OL,17,Fabout, and hopes his work will
OL,18,Fencourage more people to take an
OL,19,Finterest in local history.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
