OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran researches war graves to
OL,4,Atell town's stories
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If you go to a Remembrance parade
OL,7,Fyou're looking at a cenotaph, it's just
OL,8,Fa name on a piece of stone. I wanted to
OL,9,Fbring that person to life," he said.
